WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.423 --> 00:00:04.006
Unit two. Mental Health and Emotional Wellness!

2
00:00:04.961 --> 00:00:08.301
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.351 --> 00:00:11.315
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.365 --> 00:00:15.692
Today we learn about Mental Health and Emotional Wellness. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.829 --> 00:00:21.213
Emotional wellness. Say it with me. Emotional wellness!

6
00:00:24.692 --> 00:00:28.042
Depression. Say it with me. Depression!

7
00:00:31.555 --> 00:00:35.622
Anxiety disorder. Say it with me. Anxiety disorder!

8
00:00:39.099 --> 00:00:42.566
Warning sign. Say it with me. Warning sign!

9
00:00:46.055 --> 00:00:49.989
Professional help. Say it with me. Professional help!

10
00:00:53.531 --> 00:00:56.864
Stigma. Say it with me. Stigma!

11
00:01:00.391 --> 00:01:04.241
Resilience. Say it with me. Resilience!

12
00:01:07.649 --> 00:01:11.866
Self-care routine. Say it with me. Self-care routine!

13
00:01:15.409 --> 00:01:28.642
Emotional wellness includes recognizing a warning sign of depression or an anxiety disorder. Seeking professional help is a sign of strength, not something to feel stigma about. Building resilience through a self-care routine matters.

14
00:01:28.692 --> 00:01:31.542
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:32.829 --> 00:01:38.055
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:38.105 --> 00:01:39.573
Anxiety disorder!

17
00:01:40.496 --> 00:01:45.471
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:45.521 --> 00:01:46.671
Resilience!

19
00:01:47.561 --> 00:01:53.559
Did you know? Talking openly about mental health has been shown to encourage more people to seek help early.

20
00:01:53.609 --> 00:01:55.401
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:56.214 --> 00:02:04.707
Think and answer. Why do you think it's important to reduce stigma around mental health?

22
00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:05.907
Great answer!

23
00:02:06.962 --> 00:02:11.534
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:11.584 --> 00:02:14.242
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

